** HackerRank Question: Symmetric Pairs**
Question link: https://www.hackerrank.com/challenges/symmetric-pairs/problem?isFullScreen=true

Code:

SELECT f1.X, f1.Y
FROM Functions f1
JOIN Functions f2
ON f1.X = f2.Y AND f2.X = f1.Y
GROUP BY f1.X, f1.Y
HAVING f1.X < f1.Y or COUNT(*) > 1
ORDER BY f1.X;
